# What the worker image's build may read (the context is the repository root): the backend's
# package and the research code. No test, no evaluation question, no run record, no notebook, no
# weights. Two data files stay because the code reads them: research/agent_tuning/weights.json
# (the sha256 list) and requirements.txt (the worker-tuned build).
*
!backend/pyproject.toml
!backend/uv.lock
!backend/src
!research/*.py
!research/agent
!research/patient_agent
!research/agent_tuning
research/patient_agent/eval_questions.json
research/agent/eval_questions.json
research/agent/records
research/agent_tuning/heldout_frames.json
**/*.md
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.egg-info
